    Data_Txt_CharacterDescription: ["This cheeky fire lizard felt drawn to a strange beam of light in the distance and ended up in the Super Fighter Tournament.","Gnaw uses a range of slashes and fire attacks to keep his opponents away from the stage.","Fireball","Spit out a big fireball that flies in an arc, depending on where you're aiming it. Can light the ground on fire, too!","Big Bite","Take a big chomp that knocks opponents far away and heals you on hit.","Fire Barrage!","Fire out 7 big Fireballs in front of you at once, scorching everything in your path! ","A lost soul left behind, not sure of his purpose, just that the Super Fighter Tournament will bring him closer to finding out where he belongs.","Phantom is a nimble fighter, using fast punches and magic to keep opponents on their toes.","Shadowflame Charge","Fire a quick moving shadowflame ball that explodes on contact, or if you press the attack button!","Shadow Trick","Teleport to the opponent, leaving an explosion behind. The direction you hold determines your exact teleporting position!","Shadow Grip","Call upon a giant hand that floats towards the opponent to grab them, leaving them slowed down heavily and unable to attack or defend!","As the new holder of the Sword of Light, Arc called upon the strongest fighters across all dimensions to help him rescue his lost friend.","Arc can cover a wide range of attack types, combining slower, heavy sword attacks with lightning fast combo attacks","Lightspeed Dash","Quickly dash into the aimed direction, damaging everything in your way.","Purging Spikes","Throw your Sword into the ground, causing spears and blades of energy to emerge in front of the impact. ","Judgement","Catch the opponent in front of you, trapping them in a flurry of slashes and send them flying with a final blow!","Enraged by a beam of light hitting his home planet, Xavier the alien flew to its source to find out who caused his people trouble.","Xavier rushes down opponents with quick attacks, manipulating gravity to make himself float or opponents heavier.","Electromagnetic Sphere","Throw out a ball of energy, that keeps opponents in place on hit.","Shockpulse","Smashing into the ground, send out a pulsing shockwave, leaving opponents shocked and defenseless!","Gravitational Pull","Using all your energy, form a gigantic sphere that increases opponent's gravitational pull and causes the ground to pulsate with energy that shocks opponents.","The adventurous Snowman, accompanied by his trusty magic spoon joins the Super Fighter Tournament - and brings all his snowmen friends with him!","Edward is a floaty character, keeping opponents away with large attacks.","Snowball-Roll","Scoop up a snowball, that bounces forward, getting bigger and stronger the longer it stays out. Aim up to use it as a footstool!","Headless Snowman","Detach your head, blowing out icy winds to keep the enemy away.","Snowman Army","Call your snowman friends to chase your opponents and knock them away!","Deemed unworthy of holding the Sword of Light after trying to take the Combo Gem all for himself, this human lost himself to the \"Darc\", an evil force feeding on the spiteful and power-hungry.","Darc uses slow, but heavy attacks and keeps enemies close, with no chance of escape!","Hungry Scarfling","Your Scarfling chomps at the opponent, pulling them in. Can also be used as a grappling hook if aimed in a specific direction!","Deadly Portal","Open up three portals behind the opponent, out of which deadly blades and spears appear.","Darc Zone","Form a cage of evil energy around you, knocking opponents back to you if they try to escape.","As guardian of the Combo Gem, Rikaal was summoned by a disturbance in its sanctuary. To test the interlopers’ worth, the Super Fighter Tournament is initiated once more!","Rikaal is a heavy grappler, clawing at foes and throwing them across the stage. Slow but extremely powerful, they make use of several unblockable grab attacks!","Vice Grip","Leap forward to grab your opponent and throw them in a chosen direction. You're invulnerable during the initial dash!","Primal Roar","Let out a deafening Shockwave, sending nearby opponents flying!","Absolution","Unleash the full power of the combo gem in a devastating beam of directable energy!"],
